{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/2a34637bb2fb5cb364d9886980e43c2f.avif?t=1759214451\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">By recruiting devout believers, constructing various facilities, and planning your direction of faith upon forbidden doctrines, you will build a powerful cult to please the eldritch gods. Utilize dazzling chain reactions and combo bonuses to generate immense faith and prove your worth to the ancient beings lurking beyond the dimensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/ea68e25e698b2ae261ed365410fcd720.poster.avif?t=1759214451\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/ea68e25e698b2ae261ed365410fcd720.webm?t=1759214451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/ea68e25e698b2ae261ed365410fcd720.mp4?t=1759214451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/9ca8a04de598738bed8fa639eb67d502.avif?t=1759214451\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Whether it's a humble village or a grand sanctuary dedicated to the gods, you can recruit a variety of villagers to become your believers. From fervent housewives to loyal students, each believer has a unique role. Strategically expand your town, maximizing your faith output through unexpected building combinations like schools, bars, or hamburger joints to face the gods' increasingly demanding trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/e1629db72b39e6a60182f2ff15a9083f.poster.avif?t=1759214451\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/e1629db72b39e6a60182f2ff15a9083f.webm?t=1759214451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/e1629db72b39e6a60182f2ff15a9083f.mp4?t=1759214451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/9cfc2869f45490152f7795780f70e5e8.avif?t=1759214451\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You will face eldritch gods from beyond the rifts of spacetime. From the &quot;Shade Mantle&quot; lurking in the corner of a bedroom to the &quot;Hounds of Tindalos&quot; hunting through the angles of reality, each deity will bring unique challenges and interferences. In the &quot;Trials of the Outer Gods,&quot; you must meet their faith requirements within a limited number of turns, or your cult will be devoured by the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/6f4784ed38080a56661b1287e5de9b0e.poster.avif?t=1759214451\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/6f4784ed38080a56661b1287e5de9b0e.webm?t=1759214451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/6f4784ed38080a56661b1287e5de9b0e.mp4?t=1759214451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/d72a8ea3c18e3a548cdbb4dec1fbba79.avif?t=1759214451\" width=616 height=70 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each successful trial grants you new believers and Gold, with the chance to discover powerful relics like the &quot;Rotten Scale Jar&quot; or the &quot;Lucky Cat&quot; in treasure chests. These relics will fundamentally change your playstyle, providing powerful permanent buffs. Choose your path on the map carefully; every event choice will determine whether your cult rises to greatness or descends into madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/677b0dfff6c785c0548ae8ac28c708d0.avif?t=1759214451\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Build an infinite cult with cards\u2014try insane combinations of believers and buildings, challenge the laws of the cosmos, and watch countless mortals and gods yield before your masterfully designed faith combos.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3539480?t=1759214451","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/05e0bb84149663061c434c16ea0adb0e89bf53e4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759214451","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/3d3d7