 within a limited number of turns, or your cult will be devoured by the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/6f4784ed38080a56661b1287e5de9b0e.poster.avif?t=1759214451\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/6f4784ed38080a56661b1287e5de9b0e.webm?t=1759214451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/6f4784ed38080a56661b1287e5de9b0e.mp4?t=1759214451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/d72a8ea3c18e3a548cdbb4dec1fbba79.avif?t=1759214451\" width=616 height=70 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each successful trial grants you new believers and Gold, with the chance to discover powerful relics like the &quot;Rotten Scale Jar&quot; or the &quot;Lucky Cat&quot; in treasure chests. These relics will fundamentally change your playstyle, providing powerful permanent buffs. Choose your path on the map carefully; every event choice will determine whether your cult rises to greatness or descends into madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/extras/677b0dfff6c785c0548ae8ac28c708d0.avif?t=1759214451\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Build an infinite cult with cards\u2014try insane combinations of believers and buildings, challenge the laws of the cosmos, and watch countless mortals and gods yield before your masterfully designed faith combos.</p>","developers":["Kibi Games","Poly Poly Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539480/header.jpg?t=1759214451","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3539480/921197481/f5d176aa192c426f781eba3acc736028c85fc48f/1758028639/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758032066","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3539480/921197481/f5d176aa192c426f781eba3acc736028c85fc48f/1758028639/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758032066","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3539480/921197481/f5d176aa192c426f781eba3acc736028c85fc48f/1758028639/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758032066","id":257198739,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257198739/movie480.mp4?t=1758032066","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257198739/movie_max.mp4?t=1758032066"},"name":"DemoTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257198739/9d31f7bd612a1f02cebf0b5235b7c854270738ac/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758032066","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257198739/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758032066","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257198739/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1758032066"}}],"name":"Back of Beyond","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 or AMD FX-4100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GT 730 or Radeon HD 4830</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>